## What I Learned

### First Impressions Matter

Recruiters often spend only a few seconds reviewing a profile, making the headline and summary the most important sections.

### Keywords Improve Visibility

Using relevant industry keywords naturally throughout the profile increases discoverability in LinkedIn search.

### Personal Branding Builds Trust

Highlighting measurable achievements and clearly communicating value makes a profile more compelling.

### AI Speeds Up Profile Optimization

AI can quickly identify weak areas, suggest stronger messaging, and generate actionable improvement plans.

